Description: stereoscopic media player sView
 sView is a stereoscopic Image Viewer and Movie Player.
 Relies on OpenGL for rendering and OpenAL for sound output.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's (Capitain Jack) edition of SparkyLinux
 (https://sparkylinux.org, by Paweł "pavroo" Pijanowski).
